347:-- Locks the users (FOR SHARE, id order) and then the space (FOR SHARE) and
348:-- raises unless every user passes the room's access rules on the locked rows:
349:-- USER_NOT_FOUND / ROOM_NOT_FOUND (P0002), ROOM_ACCESS_DENIED (42501).
350:-- Called only from SECURITY DEFINER code of this migration.
351:create or replace function private.authorize_room_membership(p_user_ids uuid[], p_space_id uuid)
352:returns void
353:language plpgsql
