766:-- lifts the revocation and restores the membership. A room conversation
767:-- requires the room's access rules on the locked rows; a direct or group
768:-- conversation restores only an original participant. Returns false when the
769:-- user already is a member. Raises CONVERSATION_NOT_FOUND / ROOM_NOT_FOUND /
770:-- USER_NOT_FOUND (P0002), MEMBERSHIP_GRANT_FORBIDDEN / ROOM_ACCESS_DENIED
